        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(ii) Step Two (2): If the issue is not resolved at Step One (1), the case may be appealed within fifteen (15) calendar days of the management decision at Step One (1) to a joint review panel established by the Company and the Unions. This panel will be called the JMC Review Board and all decisions of the Board shall be final and binding. The Board will be comprised of one (1) CWA representative, one (1) IBEW",
